# Android — the NATIVE project (android/) is committed: Kotlin sources,
# Gradle build files, version catalog and brand resources. Only generated
# output and machine-specific files are ignored.
#
# Signing material never belongs in the repository: release keystores are
# supplied to CI through secrets (docs/NATIVE_ANDROID_MIGRATION_PLAN.md §9) and
# locally through environment variables.
/ios
*.keystore
*.jks
local.properties

/android/.gradle/
/android/.kotlin/
/android/.idea/
/android/build/
/android/**/build/
/android/local.properties
/android/captures/
